Local Inference Lab published the guidance and the reader design this work is
measured against: b12x (Apache-2.0) for the study discipline and the native
FP8/E8M0 row layout, its SGLang fork (Apache-2.0) for the performance and
benchmarking skills, and llm-inference-bench (MIT) for the measurement method.
The rtx6kpro KLD skill was reviewed and not applied. No source from these
repositories is redistributed here, and their kernels are not integrated into
the default image. Receipts named b12x-* in results/ are this repository's own
measurements of a bounded candidate, not results published by B12x.

B12x and prior DeepSpark/DS4 recipes are credited as related work; their kernels
are not integrated into the default image.

